<title>USA: TABLE-Genzyme Transgenics Q2 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Genzyme Transgenics Q2 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Six months ended</p>
<p>				Jun 29,     Jun 30,  Jun 29,  Jun 30,</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues		    15,594	11,371   30,528   21,724</p>
